Third-party notices for ctxprune
================================

ctxprune's own code (this repository and the ctxprune wheel / sdist) is licensed under 0BSD; see LICENSE.

Bundled third-party code
------------------------
None. The wheel and the sdist contain no source code copied from other projects (no vendored tokenizer or
runtime code). The `ctxprune/_rt/` modules are ctxprune's own scripts.

Optional dependencies (not bundled)
-----------------------------------
`pip install "ctxprune[model]"` installs these separately from PyPI, each under its own license:

  onnxruntime   MIT License            https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  tokenizers    Apache License 2.0     https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers
  numpy         BSD 3-Clause License   https://github.com/numpy/numpy

Model weights (not included, not 0BSD)
--------------------------------------
The optional lossy line-scoring model used by the `[model]` preset is distributed separately on Hugging Face,
not in this package, and is NOT covered by 0BSD. Its weights are derived from mmBERT-small (MIT License) and were
trained on data that includes CC-BY-4.0 datasets (SWE-rebench-openhands, Nemotron-SWE). The model's license and
the required attributions are stated on its Hugging Face model card.
